Cell["SMEFT ADM Explorer", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"0acf6558-539e-4ead-913b-d8d476963f3b"],

Cell["\<\
Interactive graph of the one- and two-loop anomalous dimension matrix of the \
dimension-six SMEFT (Mainz basis). The cell below loads the package from the \
folder of this notebook and starts the explorer (it runs on open; otherwise \
press Shift+Enter). Click an arrow for its entry, click an operator to \
recenter the graph.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"83bfd618-b247-4918-bd43-f65cddc69afd"],

